                  Parameters for GAMV
                  *******************

START OF PARAMETERS:
grid_2d.dat   \file with data
1 2 0   \columns for X, Y, Z coordinates
2 4 5   \number of variables, column numbers
-1.0e21 1.0e21   \trimming limits
gamv.out   \file for variogram output
4   \number of lags
1   \lag separation distance
0.5   \lag tolerance
2   \number of directions
0.0 22.5 1e21 0.0 90.0 1e21   \azm,atol,bandh,dip,dtol,bandv
0.0 90.0 1e21 0.0 90.0 1e21   \azm,atol,bandh,dip,dtol,bandv
0   \standardize sills? (0=no, 1=yes)
5   \number of variograms
1 1 3   \tail var., head var., variogram type
1 1 4   \tail var., head var., variogram type
2 2 5   \tail var., head var., variogram type
2 2 6   \tail var., head var., variogram type
2 2 7   \tail var., head var., variogram type
